                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Liberty VR is a standard wave shooter in which you can walk around in a limited area and which is set during an apocalyptic period from a fictional American Revolution scenario.\n\nWatch my first gameplay here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cDhdqkekk_U\n\nThe game isn't a bad game, but not exactly one I'd play again when I have other titles in my library that entertain me more.\nManually reloading weapons and preventing the zombie hordes from getting you is the main goal,\nin itself it was entertaining for a while but you soon get tired of the challenge,\nI quit the game not because I thought it was bad but because it seemed from a certain point that you just can't be killed,\nor you run non-stop from the directions where you see zombies and keep shooting the zombies at the same time,\nor you are looking for a place where the zombies can't reach you, because they are there too!",
